  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Established in 1999, Rainbow Hospitals is India&#xFFFD;s largest specialist paediatric and maternity care provider, providing high-quality facilities across 11 facilities in both North and South India.  Rainbow is one of the fastest growing hospital groups in India &#xFFFD; in 2017 it treated approximately 620,000 patients. It is pioneering paediatric care in India and providing specialist services for children that were previously not available in the country.  The company has won several awards, and was recognised as India&#xFFFD;s leading hospital for paediatrics, maternity and infertility care by the Times of India.</narrative>
  </description>
